  #     estimator is positively biased at small N (~(R_a-1)(R_b-1)/(2 N ln2) bits, Panzeri-Treves) — at the
  #     n=6 floor the bias alone exceeds the AGENCY_STRONG cut, so the SIGNAL trace above is INDISTINGUISHABLE
