  #     and the small stratum's plug-in MI is pure finite-sample artefact (0.108 bits, all of it bias). Comparing
  #     RAW plug-in MIs across differently-sized strata therefore reads IFR_DEGRADED off noise; debiasing each
  #     stratum by its own surrogate MEAN first reads IFR_NONE. RED-first: replace `s_mi - s_bias` with `s_mi`
