  #    information about Δpain (open-loop MI ≈ 0 → AGENCY_LOW) but PERFECT information once conditioned on the
  #    observed pain band (in the LO band action→improve, in the HI band action→worse). Open-loop buries the
  #    real feedback-conditioned agency in noise; the closed-loop companion must recover it → CL_UNDERCOUNT.
  #    RED-first: without the band conditioning, mi_closed==mi_open and the label is CL_CONCORD, not UNDERCOUNT.
  : > "$_td/algedonic.log"; : > "$_td/chat.log"
